{%- comment -%}
  Add this in sections/main-product.liquid, AFTER the closing
  </div> of .product-page (not inside .product-col--right /
  .product-info-wrapper — that's the column that was crushing it).

  Example — end of the file currently looks like:

    </div>
    </div>
  </div><!-- /.product-page -->

  Change it to:
{%- endcomment -%}

    </div>
    </div>
  </div><!-- /.product-page -->

  {%- render 'product-recommendations',
    heading: 'You May Also Like',
    products_to_show: 4,
    columns_desktop: 4,
    columns_mobile: 2
  -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Pass section_width / custom_width / section_padding too if you want
  this block's width to differ from main-product's own "Section width"
  setting — otherwise it defaults to default-width / 28px padding, same
  as before.
{%- endcomment -%}